{"nusach":"ashkenaz","id":"sheva_berachot","sections":[{"title":{"he":"שבע ברכות","en":"Sheva Berachot"},"segments":[{"key":"nbUYzhH9ps","he":[[{"t":"אחר ברכת המזון מברכים שבע ברכות על כוס שני:","s":"n"}]],"en":"After Birkat HaMazon, the Seven Berachot are said over a second cup of wine:"},{"key":"-RbC11ELeS","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, שֶׁהַכֹּל בָּרָא לִכְבוֹדוֹ:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who created everything for His glory.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"BWWZp5GIQD","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, יוֹצֵר הָאָדָם:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Former of man.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"bz6t8H5IqB","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר יָצַר אֶת הָאָדָם בְּצַלְמוֹ, בְּצֶֽלֶם דְּמוּת תַּבְנִיתוֹ, וְהִתְקִין לוֹ מִמֶּֽנּוּ בִּנְיַן עֲדֵי עַד. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, יוֹצֵר הָאָדָם:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who formed man (Adam) in His image, in the image of His likeness; and fashioned for him out of his very self a building (a wife: Eve) for eternity. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Former of Man.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"7UhXSji9cD","he":[[{"t":"שׂוֹשׂ תָּשִׂישׂ וְתָגֵל הָעֲקָרָה, בְּקִבּוּץ בָּנֶֽיהָ לְתוֹכָהּ בְּשִׂמְחָה. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ צִיּוֹן בְּבָנֶֽיהָ:"}]],"en":"May the barren one be happy and exult with the ingathering of her children into her midst with joy. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens Zion through her children.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"LV5djlOIIH","he":[[{"t":"שַׂמֵּֽחַ תְּשַׂמַּח רֵעִים הָאֲהוּבִים, כְּשַׂמֵּחֲךָ יְצִירְךָ בְּגַן עֵֽדֶן מִקֶּֽדֶם. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ חָתָן וְכַלָּה:"}]],"en":"Grant abundant joy to these beloved companions, as You gladdened Your created being in the Garden of Eden of old. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens groom and bride.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"O7Do603gJI","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, אֲשֶׁר בָּרָא שָׂשׂוֹן וְשִׂמְחָה, חָתָן וְכַלָּה, גִּילָה רִנָּה, דִּיצָה וְחֶדְוָה, אַהֲבָה וְאַחֲוָה, וְשָׁלוֹם וְרֵעוּת. מְהֵרָה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ יִשָּׁמַע בְּעָרֵי יְהוּדָה וּבְחוּצוֹת יְרוּשָׁלָֽיִם, קוֹל שָׂשׂוֹן, וְקוֹל שִׂמְחָה, קוֹל חָתָן וְקוֹל כַּלָּה, קוֹל מִצְהֲלוֹת חֲתָנִים מֵחֻפָּתָם, וּנְעָרִים מִמִּשְׁתֵּה נְגִינָתָם. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, מְשַׂמֵּֽחַ חָתָן עִם הַכַּלָּה:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe, Who created happiness and joy, groom and bride, exultation, song, pleasure, delight, love, brotherhood, peace and companionship. Soon, Adonoy, our God, may there be heard in the cities of Judah and in the streets of Jerusalem the sound of happiness and the sound of joy, the sound of the groom and sound of the bride, the sound of grooms' jubilation from their chupah, and of the youths from their feasts of song. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who gladdens the groom with the bride.","minyan":{"he":"נאמר רק במניין","en":"Said only with a minyan"}},{"key":"qtYDxZuSWW","he":[[{"t":"המזמן מברך:","s":"n"}]],"en":"The leader blesses:"},{"key":"krMOgEIEme","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הַגָּֽפֶן:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Who creates the fruit of the vine."}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear — The Metsudah Siddur (1981)","license":"CC-BY","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_Siddur_Sefard_Linear"}]}